#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0225 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a given value of PARAMCD for a subject, PCHG is populated and is not equal to ((AVAL - BASE)/BASE)*100
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col BASE type=Num
col PCHG type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 15 | 10 | 50
---
